FreeType 2.14.3 (https://freetype.org), a subset: the TrueType driver, the
sfnt module and the monochrome rasterizer, which is all the runtime needs to
draw hinted TrueType text like the Mac's scaler (src/os/qd_text.c).

From freetype-2.14.3.tar.xz (GPG signature by Werner Lemberg checked):
include/ and src/{truetype,sfnt,raster} as released; src/base/ only the files
the build compiles; build rules (*.mk) removed. Added: config/ftmodule.h (the
three modules) and config/ftoption.h, the release's ftoption.h with zlib and
PostScript glyph names turned off. The Makefile compiles it with
-DFT_CONFIG_OPTIONS_H=<ftoption.h> -DFT_CONFIG_MODULES_H=<ftmodule.h>.

